      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| label: tbl-errors\n",
        "#| tbl-cap: Error structure by field. Blank shares in the registry and the 500,000-record finder file, with the blanking rate set for each field in parentheses (FCDS's specification for SSN and address fields, pseudopeople's default elsewhere); and, among the 100,000 true pairs, the share of pairs whose two records agree exactly when both have a value and the share with a blank on either side.\n",
        "#| output: asis\n",
        "header = [\"Field\", \"Blank, registry (set)\", \"Blank, finder file (set)\", \"True pairs: agree when both present\", \"True pairs: blank on either side\"]\n",
        "print(\"| \" + \" | \".join(header) + \" |\")\n",
